###getting top 10 records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$top=10

###Skip first 10 records and print top 10 records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$skip=10&$top=10

###filter products based on category
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$filter=CATEGORY eq 'Flat Screen Monitors'

###count the total records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv/$count

###applying two filters
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$filter=CATEGORY eq 'Flat Screen Monitors'&DIM_UNIT=CM

###Selecting only required categories
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$select=PRODUCT_ID,CATEGORY,PRICE

###Order by 
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv?$select=PRODUCT_ID,CATEGORY,PRICE&orderby=PRODUCT_ID asc

###Single record using id
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ProductsSrv(74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06B26EC6052)/PRODUCT_ID

###expand 
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/PurchaseOrderSrv?$expand=Items

###Select all category names with their descriptions from the Categories table
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Customers

###
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Categories?$select=CategoryName,Description

###select the contact name, customer id, and company name of all Customers in London
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Customers?$filter=City eq 'London'&$select=CustomerID,CompanyName,ContactName,City

###get data from suppliers where fax is not null
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Suppliers?$filter=Fax ne null

###
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Orders?$select=CustomerID&$filter=OrderDate ge 1997-01-01T00:00:00Z and OrderDate lt 1998-01-01T00:00:00Z

###
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Customers?$select=CompanyName,ContactName&$filter=Country eq 'Mexico' or Country eq 'Sweden' or Country eq 'Germany'

###dicontinued products 
services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Products/$count?$filter=Discontinued eq true

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Categories?$select=CategoryName&$filter=startswith(CategoryName,'Co')

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Suppliers?$select=CompanyName,City,PostalCode,Country&$filter=contains(Address,%27rue%27)&$orderby=CompanyName%20asc

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Order_Details_Extendeds?$select=ProductID,Quantity&%apply=groupby(ProductID)

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Order_Details?$apply=groupby((ProductID),aggregate(Quantity with sum as TotalQuantity))

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Orders?$expand=Customer($select=CompanyName,Address),Shipper&$filter=Shipper/CompanyName eq 'Speedy Express'

###

https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Suppliers?$select=CompanyName,ContactName,Region,ContactTitle&$filter=Region%20ne%20null

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Products?$select=ProductName&$filter=CategoryID%20eq%202

###
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Shippers?$expand=Orders($select=Freight)

