https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Employees?$select=FirstName,LastName

###11
https://services.odata.org/V4/Northwind/Northwind.svc/Products?$select=ProductName,UnitsInStock&$filter=UnitsInStock gt 100

